{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/462e6e97697f2eb2d4cfd5c0f7ed1931.avif?t=1765670588\" width=533 height=119 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/63df56feab7b0f212212ba2e2e04deee.poster.avif?t=1765670588\" width=600 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/63df56feab7b0f212212ba2e2e04deee.webm?t=1765670588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/63df56feab7b0f212212ba2e2e04deee.mp4?t=1765670588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prequel to Grey Heritage: Faded Vision and a strong starting point for new players. Grey Heritage: Noble Duty is an anime Tactical RPG set in a medieval fantasy. Whether you are a newcomer to the genre or a veteran player, there is something for everybody. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 755, a decade before the events of Grey Heritage: Faded Vision. Emperor Augustus wages war against all of Calista. You play Jaden Ricard, a Lord of Astrea. Deemed a traitor after abandoning his posts during the invasion, Jaden must travel the continent and assemble allies from neighboring countries if he wishes to uphold his duty as a Lord of Astrea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/710cdee683044471d2ea1c9b7a3feb6a.avif?t=1765670588\" width=533 height=119 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/ac7a831b67ed345f95a35af99da5287c.poster.avif?t=1765670588\" width=600 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/ac7a831b67ed345f95a35af99da5287c.webm?t=1765670588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/ac7a831b67ed345f95a35af99da5287c.mp4?t=1765670588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your army and overcome difficult scenarios to uphold your duty as a Lord of Astrea. Train your army, manage inventories, and forge friendships as you travel this war-stricken land. A strong entry for newcomers to the genre and unique twists for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/ad08c17a658a0a89591d2f175685de33.avif?t=1765670588\" width=533 height=119 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/8786af8b8542839deaacdc79e9beccd4.poster.avif?t=1765670588\" width=600 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/8786af8b8542839deaacdc79e9beccd4.webm?t=1765670588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/8786af8b8542839deaacdc79e9beccd4.mp4?t=1765670588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some other features include:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 10-15 hour-long campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Save Feature And Rewind For The Last 10 Turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical attack inflicting states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A base to shop for inventory and get to know your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424300/extras/61d23791121c482f49a006321a1887e1.avif?t=1765670588\" width=533 height=119 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/411237109865d7f13f654307bbabd694a328640a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/46f163ec76a20cfbc30569e672b06ef41ea3b0db.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/27abab596b19d8a9aaf264ededca30348c2496f1.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/39a8b5e7493e0eb46a07c0388f545ccd264a9c1a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/2157319010575608490dea05413de36ab23458bd.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/329dbb4f3ae9d2ba54fe943380e283abfd29667d.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/e1baf834ebcd25f41fa85c77ecd57d34379e2aeb.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/c2767fe8a6aa2f1ccaa5ed2e5860dcdd385ce712.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2424300/eb7a85d2dfa1d7020bff4ca325c3b81957b3d992.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Chapter 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm